@guide H_Dustwallow
@name Dustwallow Marsh (Brackenwall Village)
@faction Horde
@levels 37-42
@zone Dustwallow Marsh
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Brackenwall Village: the Shady Rest Inn, the black shield and Paval Reethe, the Theramore spies, and the Black Dragonflight in the south.
@next Both_Tanaris

