accept Theramore Spies | Nazeer Bloodpike.
turnin 1238 The Lost Report
complete Theramore Spies | Theramore infiltrators around Brackenwall.
complete Identifying the Brood | Black dragonspawn in the south.
complete Army of the Black Dragon
complete Overlord Mok'Morokk's Concern | Mok'Morokk's Snuff: loot Mok'Morokk's Snuff. Mok'Morokk's Grog: loot Mok'Morokk's Grog.
turnin Theramore Spies
accept The Theramore Docks
complete The Theramore Docks | Captain's Documents: loot Captain's Footlocker.
