accept 1172 The Brood of Onyxia [hc=skip]
note [hc=only] | Hardcore: the eggs lie in the Wyrmbog, close to the dragonkin guarding Onyxia's Lair. Stay on the outer edge, and leave this quest out rather than go deep.
complete 1172 The Brood of Onyxia [hc=skip] | Destroy the eggs in Wyrmbog.
turnin 1172 The Brood of Onyxia [hc=skip]
